abstract: >
  Archival publication of a 2013 master's thesis examining water-energy
  infrastructure and seawater desalination in Accra, Ghana, accompanied by
  a 2026 retrospective on the subsequent history of the Teshie-Nungua
  desalination project. The release includes the original thesis, an archival
  Markdown transcription, extracted figures, and retrospective commentary.

